  "articleBody": "Thinking about a bathroom remodel? That's exciting! But sometimes, what starts as a fun DIY idea can quickly turn into a headache. So, how do you know when it’s time to call in the pros? If your project involves touching any plumbing, electrical, or waterproofing, that's a big sign. These aren't areas where you want to guess, as mistakes can lead to costly damage or even safety hazards. Also, if you're planning any structural changes, like moving walls or altering the footprint of the room, you definitely need a qualified professional. They can navigate permits, inspections, and ensure everything is up to code. Hidden conditions, like old pipes or unexpected wiring, often pop up when you open walls, and a professional can handle those surprises efficiently. At HH Remodeling LLC, we've got the experience to tackle these complex issues, from Aurora to Colorado Springs, making sure your remodel is done right and safely. Don't risk it when it comes to the bones of your home!",
  "datePublished": "2026-08-09"
}